    "detailed_description": "<h1>WE RECOMMEND YOU TO CHECK THESE GAMES...</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><strong>CHAT WITH US ON DISCORD</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1713180136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This water park is yours now. It\u2019s up to you to make it great! Tear up the old stuff and bring in the new. Fix, repair, and repaint using a selection of tools. Plan and place different attractions and elements of your aquapark. Turn this place into an amazing attraction for families from all around the world.<br><br><br><strong>Prepare the place first</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/e51e8a7c81abdee823fa1b0fab0c5737.poster.avif?t=1713180136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/e51e8a7c81abdee823fa1b0fab0c5737.webm?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/e51e8a7c81abdee823fa1b0fab0c5737.mp4?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br>The previous owners didn\u2019t leave this place in a good condition. It\u2019s now up to you to clean everything up and throw away what\u2019s not needed. An aquapark is a place where cleanliness is super important. <br><br><strong>Repair and restore</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/4f5083bb2284fdb4d16a60a7cdba4247.poster.avif?t=1713180136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/4f5083bb2284fdb4d16a60a7cdba4247.webm?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/4f5083bb2284fdb4d16a60a7cdba4247.mp4?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Some of the interiors, swimming pools, and other attractions here need your immediate attention. Use your tools to fix them step by step, put up the new tiles where the old ones used to be, and repaint what you can, so it looks nice and fresh. <br><br><strong>Arrange the attractions</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/29010b17bf233b76e06badb9c72e7976.poster.avif?t=1713180136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/29010b17bf233b76e06badb9c72e7976.webm?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/29010b17bf233b76e06badb9c72e7976.mp4?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br>Here you can truly use your creativity. Manage different elements of the water park, from choosing the right swimming pools, water slides, jacuzzis, to building relaxation zones and beach bars. Everything is up to you, but always remember that people\u2019s safety is one of the key factors of this business!<br><br><br><strong>A dream come true</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/1d3fd55c4a638c579997b815290d85b6.poster.avif?t=1713180136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/1d3fd55c4a638c579997b815290d85b6.webm?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/1d3fd55c4a638c579997b815290d85b6.mp4?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Become the owner of the greatest aquapark in the world. Make it a place where kids and adults are spending time in a friendly, fun atmosphere, and where they want to come back to as soon as they leave. <br><br><br><br><strong>Visit us on Discord -&gt;</strong> ",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><strong>CHAT WITH US ON DISCORD</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1713180136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This water park is yours now. It\u2019s up to you to make it great! Tear up the old stuff and bring in the new. Fix, repair, and repaint using a selection of tools. Plan and place different attractions and elements of your aquapark. Turn this place into an amazing attraction for families from all around the world.<br><br><br><strong>Prepare the place first</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/e51e8a7c81abdee823fa1b0fab0c5737.poster.avif?t=1713180136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/e51e8a7c81abdee823fa1b0fab0c5737.webm?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418820/extras/e51e8a7c81abdee823fa1b0fab0c5737.mp4?t=1713180136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br>The previous owners didn\u2019t leave this place in a good condition. It\u2019s now up to you to clean everything up and throw away what\u2019s not needed. An aquapark is a place where cleanliness is super important. <br><br><strong>Repair and restore</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 